  "plain": "Some people say a flying saucer crashed in Hart Canyon, near Aztec, New Mexico, around March 25, 1948. A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that a preacher named Solon Brown was there, and years later said he saw a few beings, maybe three, slumped over a kind of table or panel inside the craft. If true, it would be an eyewitness account of dead crew from a crashed craft."
